  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On Heavenly Court’s battlefield, Calamity Luck Altar presses down on Duke Long like a mountain. He clenches his fists with no intention to dodge. Heavenly Court Gu Immortal Wu Shuang activates the immortal killer move Peerless on him to lend a hand. Duke Long takes a deep breath and punches at Calamity Luck Altar with chaotic dragon fist. Fist shadows fly and set off a violent gale; Calamity Luck Altar sways as tens of millions of fist shadows strike it. Bing Sai Chuan finds Duke Long still absurdly strong even though Calamity Luck Altar received Giant Sun Immortal Venerable’s amplification.",
      "chapters": [
        1736
      ],
