    },
    {
      "text": "At Hairy Foot Mountain, inside Rumor Cage, Wu Shuang enters the battlefield and activates the human path killer move Peerless. The move was once used on Duke Long and was very helpful. This time it is used on Zhou Xiong Xin, who is already amplified by a human path killer move; with this additional boost, his killer moves become even stronger. Chi Qu You stares with furious eyes but cannot resist them, and information path tigers devour him.",
